			"widgets_values":[
				"0–3 Seconds\nLow-angle upward medium shot, cyberpunk dark comic style. Cool navy blue tone with blurred neon purple bokeh. Cold blue light covers metal walls in a neon alley. The protagonist leans against a metal pole wrapped in police tape, with long matte black curly hair. Her fingertips touch her lips lightly, with casual mockery in her eyes. She glances at the camera, cold yet charming, with shiny black pupils. The camera slowly pushes in, focusing on the silver chain reflection on her black leather gloves. Soft electronic drumbeat builds a cool, mysterious mood.\n3–5 Seconds\nSlow pan with slight low angle, 2D thick painting style, ice blue gradient lighting. She stands up, fingers sliding from lips to collarbone. Her half-unzipped black leather jacket shows a silver satin camisole. She flicks her hair, making a soft metal jingle. She looks lazy and relaxed with a faint smile. The camera rotates to capture light on her fair skin. Quick 0.4s close-ups show glove rivets and neck chain. Blue-purple neon bokeh creates a hazy vibe.\n5–8 Seconds\nCamera pulls back in 1.8x slow motion, cel-shading and thick paint mix, cobalt blue and black tones. She tucks hair behind her ear, silver earring swaying. She smiles at camera confidently, with silver-blue glitter at her eyes. She taps the ground and twists her body slightly. The camera follows her movement with close-ups of eye glitter and matte nude lipstick. SFX: electronic beats, metal clinks, hair rustling.\n8–10 Seconds\nQuick upward tilt, cyberpunk realistic style, returning to cool navy blue. She turns her back, adjusting her jacket collar as hair flows. The camera pulls back to an alley panorama. She turns and smiles cunningly at the camera. The soundtrack fades from deep drums to soft synth, ending sharply and attractively.",
				"10",
				"16:9",
				false,
				398678151063650,
				"randomize"
